  {
   "key": "func CollectorSessionControl.pauseOvernightStreaming()",
   "hash": "d98cc54834932ab8",
   "does": "Pause: claims the night's ending (StreamingLifecycle.claimOvernightEnding) before its first suspension and releases it on return, so a second pause (a tap while reconnect exhaustion auto-pauses), a Stop or a Discard returns nil untouched; holds a background-task assertion from BackgroundTaskAssertion.forRecordingStop (\"OvernightPause\") until it returns and marks the persisted recording record stop-requested; ends the arming loop, captures the original session, gathers the night (stream stop, backup, strap download, source choice); analyses and archives it as .paused when there is enough data, else saves a short paused session with the raw beats. Returns the paused session, or nil when the paused night could not be archived.",
   "entry": null,
